  "body": "## Release Notes\n\n### Added\n\n- Support for large Parquet files with large row counts in the data preview ([#43](https://github.com/kaushiksrini/parqeye/pull/43))\n- `g`/`G` shortcuts to jump to the top/bottom of the data preview ([#43](https://github.com/kaushiksrini/parqeye/pull/43))\n- PyPI package and build workflow, so you can invoke `uvx parqeye` ([#40](https://github.com/kaushiksrini/parqeye/pull/40))\n\n### Fixed\n\n- Incorrect Min/Max aggregation in the Schema tab ([#44](https://github.com/kaushiksrini/parqeye/pull/44))\n- Column file offset and distinct count now show `N/A` when not set in the file metadata ([#46](https://github.com/kaushiksrini/parqeye/pull/46))\n- PyPI workflow builds for Linux `manylinux_2_28` ([#41](https://github.com/kaushiksrini/parqeye/pull/41))\n- add `dtype-extension` to support extension types and handle panics with the polars crate ([#45](https://github.com/kaushiksrini/parqeye/pull/45))\n\n### Changed\n\n- Lazily load page info to speed up startup ([#32](https://github.com/kaushiksrini/parqeye/pull/32))\n\n## Install parqeye 0.2.0\n\n### Install prebuilt binaries via shell script\n\n```sh\ncurl --proto '=https' --tlsv1.2 -LsSf https://github.com/kaushiksrini/parqeye/releases/download/v0.2.0/parqeye-installer.sh | sh\n```\n\n### Install prebuilt binaries via Homebrew\n\n```sh\nbrew install kaushiksrini/parqeye/parqeye\n```\n\n### Install prebuilt binaries into your npm project\n\n```sh\nnpm install parqeye@0.2.0\n```\n\n## Download parqeye 0.2.0\n\n|  File  | Platform | Checksum |\n|--------|----------|----------|\n| [parqeye-aarch64-apple-darwin.tar.xz](https://github.com/kaushiksrini/parqeye/releases/download/v0.2.0/parqeye-aarch64-apple-darwin.tar.xz) | Apple Silicon macOS | [checksum](https://github.com/kaushiksrini/parqeye/releases/download/v0.2.0/parqeye-aarch64-apple-darwin.tar.xz.sha256) |\n| [parqeye-x86_64-apple-darwin.tar.xz](https://github.com/kaushiksrini/parqeye/releases/download/v0.2.0/parqeye-x86_64-apple-darwin.tar.xz) | Intel macOS | [checksum](https://github.com/kaushiksrini/parqeye/releases/download/v0.2.0/parqeye-x86_64-apple-darwin.tar.xz.sha256) |\n| [parqeye-x86_64-pc-windows-msvc.zip](https://github.com/kaushiksrini/parqeye/releases/download/v0.2.0/parqeye-x86_64-pc-windows-msvc.zip) | x64 Windows | [checksum](https://github.com/kaushiksrini/parqeye/releases/download/v0.2.0/parqeye-x86_64-pc-windows-msvc.zip.sha256) |\n| [parqeye-aarch64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.xz](https://github.com/kaushiksrini/parqeye/releases/download/v0.2.0/parqeye-aarch64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.xz) | ARM64 Linux | [checksum](https://github.com/kaushiksrini/parqeye/releases/download/v0.2.0/parqeye-aarch64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.xz.sha256) |\n| [parqeye-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.xz](https://github.com/kaushiksrini/parqeye/releases/download/v0.2.0/parqeye-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.xz) | x64 Linux | [checksum](https://github.com/kaushiksrini/parqeye/releases/download/v0.2.0/parqeye-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.xz.sha256) |\n| [parqeye-x86_64-unknown-linux-musl.tar.xz](https://github.com/kaushiksrini/parqeye/releases/download/v0.2.0/parqeye-x86_64-unknown-linux-musl.tar.xz) | x64 MUSL Linux | [checksum](https://github.com/kaushiksrini/parqeye/releases/download/v0.2.0/parqeye-x86_64-unknown-linux-musl.tar.xz.sha256) |\n\n\n"
